{"payload":{"files":{"BOOST.md":"---\nname: Hide engagement counts\nsites: x.com\nmade: Yab recipe\npreview: https://x.com/home\nchecks:\n  - on /*: none of [data-testid='tweet'] [data-testid='app-text-transition-container']\n  - on /*: some of body\n---\n\nHide numerical engagement counts on X tweets, keeping the action buttons.\n","manifest.json":"{\n  \"manifest_version\": 3,\n  \"name\": \"Hide engagement counts\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"content_scripts\": [\n    {\n      \"matches\": [\n        \"https://x.com/*\"\n      ],\n      \"css\": [\n        \"page/style.css\"\n      ],\n      \"run_at\": \"document_end\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n","page/style.css":"[data-testid='tweet'] [data-testid='app-text-transition-container'] { visibility: hidden !important; }\n"},"format":1,"id":"x-hide-counts","sites":["x.com"]},"revision":"96e1d52b9082189fdac0d32a8c4744fa31498a78fa685abad1f7328a98cde4a9"}